# Base packages of the minimal arm's per-run venv, the named stack of the lab's
# student VM (~/env). The VM is gone and its full 198-package list was not kept,
# so this matches the named stack, not the exact environment. TensorFlow is left
# out because it needs AVX, which the experiment VM's CPU does not provide. The agent may add
# more with plain pip inside its own venv. Compile with: ./dev bun run arm-lock
numpy
scipy
scikit-learn
pandas
torch
